摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness port of official pstack. Playbooks and principles are poteto's; only the harness call layer is rewritten.","id":"gh:1345934630","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"pstack-dsh","slug":"aa2246740/pstack-dsh","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness port of official pstack. Playbooks and principles are poteto's; only the harness ca"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ll layer is rewritten."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# official pstack 的 DeepSeek Harness 移植"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"## 安装 / Install"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"### 官方 DeepSeek Harness 桌面 App（推荐） / Desktop app (recommended)"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"打开 **设置 → 插件 → 添加插件**，在“包名或地址”中输入："},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Open **Settings → Plugins → Add plugin** and enter this in “Package name or address”:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"桌面端插件管理器负责 Desktop profile 和内置包管理器。本发布已包含编译好的 `lib/`；普通使用不需要 clone 或本地构建。若应用提示刷新或重新打开，请按提示完成。"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The desktop plugin manager owns the Desktop profile and bundled package manager. This release includ"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"es built `lib/`; normal use needs no clone or local build. Follow the app if it asks you to reload o"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"r reopen after installation."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Web CLI"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"这条官方 CLI 命令只写入 `web` profile，不能修改 Desktop App 的 profile。对于已运行的 Web Host，请重新打开该 Host 一次，再刷新网页。"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"This official CLI command writes only the `web` profile; it cannot modify the Desktop App profile. F"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"or an already-running Web Host, reopen that Host once and reload the page."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"面向官方 DeepSeek Harness **0.2.1-rc.5**（tag `dsh-v0.2.1-rc.5`，npm `@deepseek-ai/dsh@0.2.1-rc.5`）。Node `"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"^22.19.0` 或 `>=24`。`@deepseek-ai/dsh-*` peer 范围是 `>=0.2.1-rc.1 <0.2.2`，接受 `0.2.1-rc.5`，拒绝 `0.2.0` 系列"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"4`。`@deepseek-ai/dsh-*` peer 范围是 `>=0.2.1-rc.1 <0.2.2`，接受 `0.2.1-rc.5`，拒绝 `0.2.0` 系列与 `0.2.1` alpha。"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Targets official DeepSeek Harness **0.2.1-rc.5** (tag `dsh-v0.2.1-rc.5`, npm `@deepseek-ai/dsh@0.2.1"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"-rc.5`). Node `^22.19.0` or `>=24`. The `@deepseek-ai/dsh-*` peer range is `>=0.2.1-rc.1 <0.2.2`: it"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" accepts `0.2.1-rc.5` and rejects the `0.2.0` series and `0.2.1` alphas."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**English title.** pstack-dsh, a DeepSeek Harness port of official pstack."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**中文.** 这是 official pstack 的 DeepSeek Harness 移植。玩法和原则来自 poteto 的 official pstack；只有调用层换成 DSH。"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**English.** This is a DeepSeek Harness port of official pstack. Playbooks and principles are poteto"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"'s. Only the harness call layer is swapped."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## 来源 / Credits"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"23 个玩法（playbooks）和 23 条原则（principles）是 poteto 写的，出自 official pstack。本仓库是 DeepSeek Harness 移植（aa22467"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"40/pstack-dsh）。调用层用 HARNESS.md 里的 DSH 工具名。玩法和原则不是本仓库写的。"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The 23 playbooks and 23 principles are poteto's, from official pstack. This repository is the DeepSe"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ek Harness port (aa2246740/pstack-dsh). Harness calls use DSH tools named in HARNESS.md. This port d"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"id not author those playbooks or principles."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## 本地目录 / Local checkout"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"已经 clone 到本机时（开发/本地测试）："},{"id":"p24s1","text":"A local checkout (development/local testing):"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"然后同样重启 Host，再刷新页面。"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Then restart that Host and reload the page."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Desktop App 请使用上面的应用内“添加插件”入口。官方 CLI 只管理 `web` profile。"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Use the in-app “Add plugin” entry above for the Desktop App. The public CLI manages the `web` profil"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" in-app “Add plugin” entry above for the Desktop App. The public CLI manages the `web` profile only."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## 开始用 / Get started"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"两步。"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Two steps."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"1. 要做事、要严谨，直接用 `/poteto-mode`。不用先跑 setup。子 agent 默认继承当前对话的路由。\n2. 只有想给某个角色换已登录的路由时，打开 **设置 → pstack**"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"（导航「pstack 角色」/「pstack roles」）。页面写入 `$DSH_HOME/pstack-dsh.json`。`/setup-pstack` 只是指向那一页的指针。"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"1. Use `/poteto-mode` for work that needs rigor. No setup required. Children inherit this conversati"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"on's route.\n2. To pin a logged-in route per role, open **Settings → pstack** (nav label **pstack 角色*"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"* / **pstack roles**). The page writes `$DSH_HOME/pstack-dsh.json`. `/setup-pstack` is an optional p"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"ointer to that page."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"角色模型列表会随 DSH 的登录、退出登录和模型目录变更通知更新，也可点击「刷新模型列表」。刷新只更新候选项，不覆盖尚未保存的角色和 effort；当前选择若失去登录会标为「暂不可用」。新加入 dsh"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"-oauth-login 的 `pi-*` 路由以及 dsh-antigravity-oauth 的 `agy-*` 路由只要已登录且已注册，就会自动纳入，无需在 pstack 里再维护一份提供商名单"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"oauth-login 的 `pi-*` 路由以及 dsh-antigravity-oauth 的 `agy-*` 路由只要已登录且已注册，就会自动纳入，无需在 pstack 里再维护一份提供商名单。"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Model choices follow DSH login/logout and catalog notifications. **Refresh models** also updates the"},{"id":"p37s2","text":" choices without replacing unsaved role/effort edits. A selected route that becomes unavailable stay"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"s visibly marked. Newly registered, signed-in `pi-*` and `agy-*` routes are discovered without a sec"},{"id":"p37s4","text":"ond provider allowlist."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"The locally authenticated `cursor` provider is also discovered when\ndsh-cursor-passthrough\nis instal"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"led and exposes live models. This lets a DSH parent assign a pstack\nrole to a Cursor subscription mo"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"del without storing Cursor credentials in DSH."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"安装并启用 dsh-cursor-passthrough\n后，pstack 也会发现由本机 Cursor CLI 登录的 `cursor` 提供商。这样 DSH 父对话可以把指定角色分配给 Curso"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"r 订阅模型，无需在 DSH 中保存 Cursor 凭据。"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"For mixed routing, keep the parent conversation on a native DSH provider and\nassign Cursor models to"},{"id":"p40s2","text":" selected roles in **Settings → pstack**. `pstack_spawn`\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## 上游 0.15 同步"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"技能内容同步至 `cursor/plugins` 的 pstack 0.15.0，提交 `71ed0d1076fec562c1b74ee353121a8d00f75382`。保留 DSH 工具和角色路"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"内容同步至 `cursor/plugins` 的 pstack 0.15.0，提交 `71ed0d1076fec562c1b74ee353121a8d00f75382`。保留 DSH 工具和角色路由。"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## 推荐依赖 / Recommended peer"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"订阅与服务登录（ChatGPT / Claude / Grok / Copilot / OpenRouter / Kimi / Google Antigravity）要出现在 **设置 → pstac"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"k** 列表里，可按需安装 dsh-oauth-login 或 dsh-antigravity-oauth。不是硬依赖。只用 API key 的用户可以不装。本插件不读写 `~/.pi`、`~/.co"},{"id":"p45s3","text":"dex`、`~/.claude`、grok CLI 登录文件。"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"Subscription logins show up on **Settings → pstack** after you install dsh-oauth-login or dsh-antigr"},{"id":"p46s2","text":"avity-oauth. They are not required. API-key-only users work without them. This plugin does not read "},{"id":"p46s3","text":"or write official CLI auth files."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
